.TH "core:verify-checksums" 1 "September 2026" "SPP Framework" "SPP Commands Manual"
.SH NAME
core:verify-checksums \- Verify integrity of core SPP framework files using SHA-256 checksums
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B php spp.php core:verify-checksums
[\fB\-\-generate\fR]
[\fB\-\-strict\fR]
[\fB\-\-json\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
\fBcore:verify-checksums\fR verifies that all core engine files within the SPP framework remain untouched, authentic, and consistent with known baseline hashes. It detects modified code, deleted files, and untracked injected scripts.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-generate\fR
Generate or regenerate the baseline \fBspp/etc/checksums.json\fR signature manifest.
.TP
\fB\-\-strict\fR
Fail with a non-zero exit code if any untracked or modified files are detected.
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Emit machine-readable verification summary as JSON.
.SH UNDER THE HOOD
.IP \(bu 3
Filesystem traversal: Iterates through \fBspp/core\fR and \fBspp/modules/spp\fR.
.IP \(bu 3
Cryptographic hashing: Computes SHA-256 digests using PHP native hashing functions.
.IP \(bu 3
Manifest persistence: Compares against or generates \fBspp/etc/checksums.json\fR.
